Esp32Tap Rev E whole-board sequencing: 8 V rail to K1 coil current, one connected behavioral chain (.include models/behavioral.inc)
* ASSUMPTIONS:
* WHAT IS CONNECTED. Every scenario is a separate copy of ONE subcircuit,
* SEQCHAIN, built from tools/design.py: 8 V source -> 0.5 ohm source ->
* F1 (0.11 ohm) -> D1 SS34 -> VIN (26 uF, 22 uF in the one marked copy) with
* D3 SMBJ10A; U2 buck -> +3V3; U4 window (R17/R18 150k/10k, R19/R20 255k/10k,
* C18/C19 1 nF, R21 10k pull-up to +3V3, R22 100k, R33 1 Mohm from TREAD_OK to
* UV_SENSE) -> TREAD_OK; U6 AND (ESP_AND_GATE) -> RELAY_GATE; RELAY_GATE enables
* U5 (5 V LDO from VIN) AND drives Q1 through R9/R10; Q1 emitter -> Q3 (ESP_Q3)
* fed by the RELAY_PULSE charge pump (PUMP); K1 coil 237 ohm, 0.5 H, D4 clamp,
* C16 4.7 uF. NOTE: the task brief says TREAD_OK enables U5; tools/design.py
* (net RELAY_GATE: U5.3 EN, U6.7, R9.1, R24.1) says RELAY_GATE enables U5. The
* netlist is followed here.
* BUCK. Averaged: UVLO 4.2 V rising / 3.9 V falling (an engineering
* assumption, not re-read from the TPS54202 data sheet), 5 ms linear soft
* start, 0.1 ohm output resistance into 50 uF, 50 mA 3V3 load, 90 percent
* efficiency input current plus 45 uA. VIN loading therefore follows VIN.
* U4. Thresholds are a nominal 400 mV rising / 393.5 mV falling (the midpoints
* of the 396...404 and 387...400 mV corners used by tread_permission.cir) on
* UV_SENSE (falling for UV) and OV_SENSE (rising for OV). The "narrow" copies
* use 397.0 / 396.5 mV, because those data-sheet corners overlap and do not
* guarantee positive hysteresis. Outputs are held low below VIN = 1.8 V,
* asserted 18 us after a violation, released 450 us after the window is
* satisfied (RC delays as in tread_permission.cir). TREAD_OK is a real node:
* R21 pull-up to the modelled +3V3, R22, R33 into UV_SENSE, open-drain switch.
* R33 therefore feeds back through the real divider (no hand-set hysteresis).
* U5. 5 V Thevenin source (2 ohm) = min(5, VIN - 0.3) when RELAY_GATE > 1.2 V
* (0.3 V dropout and 1.2 V EN threshold are assumptions), 1.5 ms soft start.
* Its input current equals its output current.
* Q1. Generic Gummel-Poon NPN (Is 5e-16, Bf 250, assumed), NOT a BC817-40
* vendor model. Q3/D8/C22/C23/R34/R35 are the existing relay_drive_release.cir
* blocks, Q3 threshold 1.05 V (0.65 / 1.45 V in the corners marked).
* MCU. RELAY_CMD and RELAY_PULSE are ideal logic levels multiplied by the
* modelled +3V3 voltage, so a pin never exceeds its supply and falls with the
* rail. RELAY_PULSE is a 1 kHz, 50 percent square wave with 20 us edges
* (existing decks use 1 us; slower edges are used to keep run time down).
* While +3V3 is alive the pins re-assert the instant it returns: no MCU
* reboot, no firmware logic, no watchdog is modelled.
* STIMULUS. The 8 V source ramps 0 -> 8 V in 1 ms. Brownouts are applied at
* the SOURCE (ahead of F1/D1) with 20 us edges; D1 blocks reverse current, so
* VIN falls only as fast as its loads discharge 26 uF. Scenario 3 ramps 1 V
* per 100 ms with a 1 kHz sine ripple at the source (about 100 mV peak-to-peak
* at VIN, see s3a_vin_ripple_pp_v).
* SCENARIOS (copy names): s1 normal power-up and shutdown; s2 pins asserted
* from t=0; s3a/s3b/s3c slow ramp, R33 fitted / removed / removed with the
* narrow comparator band; s4_<level>_<duration> brownout while emulating
* (6.5, 6.0, 5.0, 3.0 V for 10 ms, 6.5 and 3.0 V also for 100 ms, and 3.0 V
* for 1 ms with VIN at 22 uF; the other level/duration pairs were not run
* for run time); s5 12 V step; s6a/s6b power removed in 20 us / 50 ms; s7a-c MCU
* hang with RELAY_CMD high (a/b held low at the 0.65 / 1.45 V Q3 corners, c held
* high). All copies start at 0 V with no stored energy.
* MEASUREMENT TRICKS. Edge counts are "cnt" capacitors integrating
* (digitised level - 100 us lag)+ / 100 us, so one clean edge adds 1 V; they
* are resolution limited, so a chatter burst of short pulses reads as a
* non-integer. nlt / nlc are 1 minus a latched "first TREAD_OK-low / first
* coil-below-2 mA after T0" flag: INTEGrating them gives the time from T0 to the
* first event, or the whole window if it never happens.
* SOLVER. .options reltol=0.01 is used to keep the 18-copy run near 7 s. A
* trial with the default reltol moved timing results by under 0.1 percent;
* chatter counts moved by about one count (they carry wide limits).
* NON-CLAIMS:
* Behavioral model only: the AND gate is a truth table with a rail
* dependence, U4 is thresholds plus RC delays, U2 is an averaged source with
* an assumed UVLO, U5 is an ideal source with an assumed dropout. Nothing
* here is measured. K1 contact motion is not modeled; coil current is the only
* output, so "release" means coil current below 2 mA (nothing proves the
* contacts have opened) and "pickup" means 14.7 mA.
* AFTER A BROWNOUT THE COIL RE-ENERGIZES BY ITSELF when VIN returns if the
* MCU still asserts RELAY_CMD and RELAY_PULSE and +3V3 never dropped (in the
* 3 V cases +3V3 collapses and this model re-asserts the pins instantly when
* it returns, which a real ESP32 reboot would not). Hardware
* does not latch a fault. Firmware must treat TREAD_OK loss as a latched
* event; this deck does not show it does.
* MCU boot/reset behavior, GPIO threshold and pad-leakage corners, ESP32
* brownout detector, TX_GATE/UART path, EMI, and relay mechanical timing are
* not modeled. Tolerance corners are covered only where named above.
* A 1 ms dip is at the edge of VIN ride-through at 26 uF (VIN falls about
* 1.7 V in 1 ms from 7.7 V toward the 5.9 V trip point); a 3 V / 1 ms copy at
* 26 uF flipped between "trip" and "no trip" with solver step, so it is not
* asserted. Only the 22 uF copy, which trips with margin, is.


.include models/behavioral.inc

* Generic Gummel-Poon stand-in for Q1 (assumed Is/Bf, NOT a BC817-40 vendor model).
.model ESP_Q1 NPN(Is=5e-16 Bf=250 Vaf=80 Rb=5 Re=0.3 Rc=0.3 Cje=10p Cjc=5p)
* Hysteretic comparator switch: control is scaled so that +/-1 V is the band.
.model ESP_SWH SW(Ron=1 Roff=1e12 Vt=0 Vh=1)
.model ESP_SW_PULLDOWN SW(Ron=100 Roff=1e12 Vt=-1.65 Vh=0.05)
.model ESP_SW_LATCH SW(Ron=0.05 Roff=1e15 Vt=1.65 Vh=0.05)
.model ESP_SW_U5 SW(Ron=0.05 Roff=1e12 Vt=1.2 Vh=0.05)

* The whole Rev E sequencing chain: protected VIN -> U4 window (with R33) ->
* TREAD_OK -> U6 AND -> RELAY_GATE -> U5 / Q1 -> K1 coil, Q3 behind Q1's
* emitter fed by the RELAY_PULSE charge pump.  src is the 8 V treadmill rail
* before F1.  cmdl / pls are LOGIC levels 0..1 from the MCU, scaled by the
* modelled +3V3 rail so a pin can never exceed its supply.
* Observation nodes (read hierarchically as x<n>.<name>): icoil (1 V = 1 A),
* col, nlt/nlc (latch-based time-to-event), cnt_* (edge counters), gv, cv.
.subckt SEQCHAIN src cmdl pls params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m VMID=0.39675 Q3VT=1.05 T0=0 CINV=26u

* --- input protection: source, F1, D1, D3, VIN capacitance ---
RSRC src f1a 0.5
RF1 f1a d1a 0.11
DD1 d1a vin ESP_SS34
CIN vin 0 {CINV}
DD3 0 vin ESP_SMBJ10A

* --- U2 TPS54202: averaged buck, UVLO 4.2 V rise / 3.9 V fall (assumed),
* 5 ms soft start, 90 percent efficiency, 50 mA 3V3 load ---
VLG lg 0 3.3
BBC bc 0 V={(v(vin)-4.05)/0.15}
SBEN lg en bc 0 ESP_SWH
REN en 0 1k
CSS ss 0 1u
BSSI 0 ss I={u(v(en)-1.65)*min(max((3.3-v(ss))/0.01,0),1)*0.66m}
SSSD ss 0 0 en ESP_SW_PULLDOWN
BREG 0 rail I={max(v(ss)-v(rail),0)/0.1}
CRAIL rail 0 50u
BLOAD rail 0 I={0.05*min(max(v(rail)/3.3,0),1)}
BIN vin 0 I={u(v(en)-1.65)*(45u+v(rail)*max(v(ss)-v(rail),0)/0.1/(0.9*max(v(vin),2)))}

* --- U4 TPS3700 window with R33 hysteresis, TREAD_OK wired net ---
R17 vin uv 150k
R18 uv 0 10k
C18 uv 0 1n
R33 tok uv {R33V}
R19 vin ov 255k
R20 ov 0 10k
C19 ov 0 1n
BUVC uvc 0 V={(VMID-v(uv))/HYS}
BOVC ovc 0 V={(v(ov)-VMID)/HYS}
SUVF lg fu uvc 0 ESP_SWH
SOVF lg fo ovc 0 ESP_SWH
RFU fu 0 1k
RFO fo 0 1k
BOKR okr 0 V={3.3*u(v(vin)-1.8)*u(1.65-v(fu))*u(1.65-v(fo))}
RSTART okr ready 649.213k
CSTART ready 0 1n
RRESET ready rres 25.97k
DRESET rres okr ESP_SIGNAL_DIODE
R21 rail tok 10k
R22 tok 0 100k
STOK tok 0 0 ready ESP_SW_PULLDOWN

* --- MCU pins (powered from +3V3), U6 AND, RELAY_GATE ---
BCMD cmdp 0 V={v(rail)*min(max(v(cmdl),0),1)}
R23 cmdp 0 10k
BPLS pp 0 V={v(rail)*min(max(v(pls),0),1)}
XU6 cmdp tok rail gate ESP_AND_GATE
R24 gate 0 10k

* --- U5 TPS70950: 5 V from VIN (assumed 0.3 V dropout), enable = RELAY_GATE,
* 1.5 ms soft start, 2 ohm Thevenin output, C16 ---
BU5T u5t 0 V={u(v(gate)-1.2)*max(min(5,v(vin)-0.3),0)}
RU5S u5t u5r 469k
CU5S u5r 0 1n
DU5R u5r u5t ESP_SIGNAL_DIODE
BU5O u5o 0 V=v(u5r)
SU5 u5o u5s gate 0 ESP_SW_U5
VS5 u5s u5m 0
RU5 u5m r5 2
BLDO vin 0 I={max(i(VS5),0)}
C16 r5 0 4.7u

* --- K1 coil, D4, Q1 (R9/R10), Q3 behind Q1 emitter, charge pump ---
LK1 r5 kl 0.5
RK1 kl ks 237
VCS ks col 0
XD4 r5 col ESP_BIDI_TVS params: VCLAMP=7.02 RDYN=0.094
R9 gate qb 560
R10 qb 0 10k
Q1 col qb qe ESP_Q1
XPUMP pp q3g PUMP
XQ3 qe q3g ESP_Q3 params: VT={Q3VT}
HCOIL icoil 0 VCS 1

* --- observation only: digitised levels and edge counters (1 V of cnt per
* edge: current (level - 100 us lag)+ / 100 us integrated on a 1 F capacitor) ---
BDT dt 0 V={u(v(tok)-1.65)}
RLT dt tl 1
CLT tl 0 100u
* coil 'on' = above 15.5 mA (certain operate), 'off' = below 2 mA (certain
* release); a dip that stays between the two is not counted as an event
BDCC dcc 0 V={(v(icoil)-0.00875)/0.00675}
SDC lg dcr dcc 0 ESP_SWH
RDC dcr 0 1k
BDC dc 0 V={u(v(dcr)-1.65)}
RLC dc cl 1
CLC cl 0 100u
BDG dg 0 V={u(v(gate)-1.65)}
RLG dg gl 1
CLG gl 0 100u
BTU 0 cnt_tu I={u(time-T0)*max(v(dt)-v(tl),0)/100u}
BTD 0 cnt_td I={u(time-T0)*max(v(tl)-v(dt),0)/100u}
BCU 0 cnt_cu I={u(time-T0)*max(v(dc)-v(cl),0)/100u}
BCD 0 cnt_cd I={u(time-T0)*max(v(cl)-v(dc),0)/100u}
BGU 0 cnt_gu I={u(time-T0)*max(v(dg)-v(gl),0)/100u}
CTU cnt_tu 0 1
CTD cnt_td 0 1
CCU cnt_cu 0 1
CCD cnt_cd 0 1
CGU cnt_gu 0 1
RTU cnt_tu 0 1e12
RTD cnt_td 0 1e12
RCU cnt_cu 0 1e12
RCD cnt_cd 0 1e12
RGU cnt_gu 0 1e12
* latches (a capacitor charged through a switch whose Roff is 1e15 ohm, so only
* gmin discharges it): first TREAD_OK-low and first coil<2 mA after T0, never reset
BLTC ltc 0 V={3.3*u(1.65-v(tok))*u(time-T0)}
SLT lg lt ltc 0 ESP_SW_LATCH
CLTL lt 0 100n
BLCC lcc 0 V={3.3*u(0.002-v(icoil))*u(time-T0)}
SLCL lg lc lcc 0 ESP_SW_LATCH
CLCL lc 0 100n
BNLT nlt 0 V={1-u(v(lt)-1.65)}
BNLC nlc 0 V={1-u(v(lc)-1.65)}
* coil current while TREAD_OK is low; RELAY_GATE while TREAD_OK is low
BCV cv 0 V={v(icoil)*u(1.65-v(tok))}
BGV gv 0 V={v(gate)*u(0.8-v(tok))}
* re-energize / glitch detectors: coil current from 0.35 ms after it first
* fell below 0.5 mA, and RELAY_GATE from 0.35 ms after it first fell below
* 0.1 V (the 0.5 ms RC lag skips the final decay tail)
BL5C l5c 0 V={3.3*u(0.0005-v(icoil))*u(time-T0)}
SL5 lg l5 l5c 0 ESP_SW_LATCH
CL5 l5 0 100n
BLGC lgc 0 V={3.3*u(0.1-v(gate))*u(time-T0)}
SLG lg lgl lgc 0 ESP_SW_LATCH
CLGL lgl 0 100n
RL5D l5 l5d 1k
CL5D l5d 0 500n
RLGD lgl lgd 1k
CLGD lgd 0 500n
* start every latch cleared
.ic v(lt)=0 v(lc)=0 v(l5)=0 v(lgl)=0
BPK pk 0 V={v(icoil)*u(v(l5d)-1.65)}
BPKG pkg 0 V={v(gate)*u(v(lgd)-1.65)}
.ends SEQCHAIN

* ---- copy s1 ----
Vs1SRC ss1 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 140m 8 141m 0 200m 0)
Vs1CMD cs1 0 PWL(0 0 50m 0 50.01m 1 100m 1 100.01m 0)
Vs1SQ qs1 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs1ENV es1 0 PWL(0 0 20m 0 20.001m 1 110m 1 110.001m 0)
Vs1HLD hs1 0 0
Bs1PLS ps1 0 V=v(qs1)*v(es1)+v(hs1)*(1-v(es1))
Xs1 ss1 cs1 ps1 SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s2 ----
Vs2SRC ss2 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8)
Vs2CMD cs2 0 1
Vs2SQ qs2 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs2ENV es2 0 1
Vs2HLD hs2 0 0
Bs2PLS ps2 0 V=v(qs2)*v(es2)+v(hs2)*(1-v(es2))
Xs2 ss2 cs2 ps2 SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s3a ----
Vs3aBASE bs3a 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 3m 5.9 30m 5.9 130m 6.9 150m 6.9 290m 5.5 300m 5.5)
Bs3aSRC ss3a 0 V=v(bs3a)+0.055*sin(6.2832e3*time)*u(time-0.03)
Vs3aCMD cs3a 0 1
Vs3aSQ qs3a 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs3aENV es3a 0 1
Vs3aHLD hs3a 0 0
Bs3aPLS ps3a 0 V=v(qs3a)*v(es3a)+v(hs3a)*(1-v(es3a))
Xs3a ss3a cs3a ps3a SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s3b ----
Vs3bBASE bs3b 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 3m 5.9 30m 5.9 130m 6.9 150m 6.9 290m 5.5 300m 5.5)
Bs3bSRC ss3b 0 V=v(bs3b)+0.055*sin(6.2832e3*time)*u(time-0.03)
Vs3bCMD cs3b 0 1
Vs3bSQ qs3b 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs3bENV es3b 0 1
Vs3bHLD hs3b 0 0
Bs3bPLS ps3b 0 V=v(qs3b)*v(es3b)+v(hs3b)*(1-v(es3b))
Xs3b ss3b cs3b ps3b SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1G HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s3c ----
Vs3cBASE bs3c 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 3m 5.9 30m 5.9 130m 6.9 150m 6.9 290m 5.5 300m 5.5)
Bs3cSRC ss3c 0 V=v(bs3c)+0.055*sin(6.2832e3*time)*u(time-0.03)
Vs3cCMD cs3c 0 1
Vs3cSQ qs3c 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs3cENV es3c 0 1
Vs3cHLD hs3c 0 0
Bs3cPLS ps3c 0 V=v(qs3c)*v(es3c)+v(hs3c)*(1-v(es3c))
Xs3c ss3c cs3c ps3c SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1G HYS=0.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s4_65_10m ----
Vs4_65_10mSRC ss4_65_10m 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 6.5 70.00000m 6.5 70.02000m 8 300m 8)
Vs4_65_10mCMD cs4_65_10m 0 1
Vs4_65_10mSQ qs4_65_10m 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs4_65_10mENV es4_65_10m 0 1
Vs4_65_10mHLD hs4_65_10m 0 0
Bs4_65_10mPLS ps4_65_10m 0 V=v(qs4_65_10m)*v(es4_65_10m)+v(hs4_65_10m)*(1-v(es4_65_10m))
Xs4_65_10m ss4_65_10m cs4_65_10m ps4_65_10m SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s4_65_100m ----
Vs4_65_100mSRC ss4_65_100m 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 6.5 160.00000m 6.5 160.02000m 8 300m 8)
Vs4_65_100mCMD cs4_65_100m 0 1
Vs4_65_100mSQ qs4_65_100m 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs4_65_100mENV es4_65_100m 0 1
Vs4_65_100mHLD hs4_65_100m 0 0
Bs4_65_100mPLS ps4_65_100m 0 V=v(qs4_65_100m)*v(es4_65_100m)+v(hs4_65_100m)*(1-v(es4_65_100m))
Xs4_65_100m ss4_65_100m cs4_65_100m ps4_65_100m SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s4_60_10m ----
Vs4_60_10mSRC ss4_60_10m 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 6.0 70.00000m 6.0 70.02000m 8 300m 8)
Vs4_60_10mCMD cs4_60_10m 0 1
Vs4_60_10mSQ qs4_60_10m 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs4_60_10mENV es4_60_10m 0 1
Vs4_60_10mHLD hs4_60_10m 0 0
Bs4_60_10mPLS ps4_60_10m 0 V=v(qs4_60_10m)*v(es4_60_10m)+v(hs4_60_10m)*(1-v(es4_60_10m))
Xs4_60_10m ss4_60_10m cs4_60_10m ps4_60_10m SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s4_50_10m ----
Vs4_50_10mSRC ss4_50_10m 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 5.0 70.00000m 5.0 70.02000m 8 300m 8)
Vs4_50_10mCMD cs4_50_10m 0 1
Vs4_50_10mSQ qs4_50_10m 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs4_50_10mENV es4_50_10m 0 1
Vs4_50_10mHLD hs4_50_10m 0 0
Bs4_50_10mPLS ps4_50_10m 0 V=v(qs4_50_10m)*v(es4_50_10m)+v(hs4_50_10m)*(1-v(es4_50_10m))
Xs4_50_10m ss4_50_10m cs4_50_10m ps4_50_10m SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s4_30_10m ----
Vs4_30_10mSRC ss4_30_10m 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 3.0 70.00000m 3.0 70.02000m 8 300m 8)
Vs4_30_10mCMD cs4_30_10m 0 1
Vs4_30_10mSQ qs4_30_10m 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs4_30_10mENV es4_30_10m 0 1
Vs4_30_10mHLD hs4_30_10m 0 0
Bs4_30_10mPLS ps4_30_10m 0 V=v(qs4_30_10m)*v(es4_30_10m)+v(hs4_30_10m)*(1-v(es4_30_10m))
Xs4_30_10m ss4_30_10m cs4_30_10m ps4_30_10m SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s4_30_100m ----
Vs4_30_100mSRC ss4_30_100m 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 3.0 160.00000m 3.0 160.02000m 8 300m 8)
Vs4_30_100mCMD cs4_30_100m 0 1
Vs4_30_100mSQ qs4_30_100m 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs4_30_100mENV es4_30_100m 0 1
Vs4_30_100mHLD hs4_30_100m 0 0
Bs4_30_100mPLS ps4_30_100m 0 V=v(qs4_30_100m)*v(es4_30_100m)+v(hs4_30_100m)*(1-v(es4_30_100m))
Xs4_30_100m ss4_30_100m cs4_30_100m ps4_30_100m SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s4_30_1m ----
Vs4_30_1mSRC ss4_30_1m 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 3.0 61.00000m 3.0 61.02000m 8 300m 8)
Vs4_30_1mCMD cs4_30_1m 0 1
Vs4_30_1mSQ qs4_30_1m 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs4_30_1mENV es4_30_1m 0 1
Vs4_30_1mHLD hs4_30_1m 0 0
Bs4_30_1mPLS ps4_30_1m 0 V=v(qs4_30_1m)*v(es4_30_1m)+v(hs4_30_1m)*(1-v(es4_30_1m))
Xs4_30_1m ss4_30_1m cs4_30_1m ps4_30_1m SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=22u
* ---- copy s5 ----
Vs5SRC ss5 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 12 80m 12 80.02m 8 200m 8)
Vs5CMD cs5 0 1
Vs5SQ qs5 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs5ENV es5 0 1
Vs5HLD hs5 0 0
Bs5PLS ps5 0 V=v(qs5)*v(es5)+v(hs5)*(1-v(es5))
Xs5 ss5 cs5 ps5 SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s6a ----
Vs6aSRC ss6a 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 60.02m 0 160m 0)
Vs6aCMD cs6a 0 1
Vs6aSQ qs6a 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs6aENV es6a 0 1
Vs6aHLD hs6a 0 0
Bs6aPLS ps6a 0 V=v(qs6a)*v(es6a)+v(hs6a)*(1-v(es6a))
Xs6a ss6a cs6a ps6a SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s6b ----
Vs6bSRC ss6b 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 8 60m 8 110m 0 160m 0)
Vs6bCMD cs6b 0 1
Vs6bSQ qs6b 0 PULSE(0 1 0 20u 20u 0.48m 1m)
Vs6bENV es6b 0 1
Vs6bHLD hs6b 0 0
Bs6bPLS ps6b 0 V=v(qs6b)*v(es6b)+v(hs6b)*(1-v(es6b))
Xs6b ss6b cs6b ps6b SEQCHAIN params: R33V=1Meg HYS=3.25m Q3VT=1.05 T0=0.06 CINV=26u
* ---- copy s7a ----
